First-preview qualification and delivery

Status: DONE
Milestone: Runnable native preview with honest limits
Dependencies: 02_NATIVE_CAPTURE, 03_DESKTOP_CONTROLS
Purpose: Verify the actual capture path and document how to use and develop it.

Tasks:
- [x] Build and run focused crop/color-mask tests.
- [x] Exercise native capture and UI paths against original synthetic fixtures.
- [x] Check cancellation, source closure, opacity/keying and recovery.
- [x] Produce a local executable and document build/run commands.
- [x] Update user guide, architecture/algorithms, ledger and owned context.
- [x] Record environmental and human-acceptance limits separately.

Acceptance criteria:
- Actual native executable launches and its synthetic capture receives live frames.
- No private browser/desktop capture is needed for evidence.
- Resource observations identify fixture and time window; no universal budget claim.
- No commit, push, installer activation or release without explicit authorization.

Completion evidence:
- scripts\build.ps1 -Test: native Release build and both CTest targets pass;
  18 pure crop/pixel cases and 26 native integration checks.
- scripts\smoke-launch.ps1: normal startup, close-to-tray, controls recovery and
  exit pass. Its process was stopped normally; no helper remains running.
- clang-format --dry-run --Werror and git diff --check pass.
- Executable: build\Release\WindowPane.exe, unsigned local x64 preview.
  The 2026-11-06 01:44 run produced 391168 bytes; SHA256
  522BF173E1D9D45BA9711DBB50D040AC261BABF31F0356E3053F6D16C56FB893.
- Environment: Windows version 10.0.26200.0, Windows SDK 10.0.26100.0,
  MSVC 19.44.35229.0. No clean-machine, other-GPU, HDR, protected-app or
  all-source-application compatibility claim.
- Controlled original fixture observation: 180x110 crop, selected rate 5 fps,
  5016ms sample, 22 received frames, process CPU 0.623006% of one logical core,
  working set 48328704 bytes, private bytes 30261248. Not a general budget;
  external DWM/GPU work is not included in process CPU time.
- Actual synthetic input/output and owned controls images were inspected.
  Native source and pixel guards forbid private desktop capture during tests.
- Human acceptance remains pending. No commit, install, startup task or
  publication was performed.

Completion log:
- 2026-11-06: Initial bounded qualification plan.
- 2026-11-06: Delivered a locally qualified first preview and updated its guides.
